#. Description of the plugin
#: groundwork-common-volunteer-tracker.php
msgid "Log volunteer hours, have staff attest to them, and produce a verification letter a court or a school will accept from the person who earned it. Built for the nonprofits who host mandated service and currently do this on paper."
msgstr ""

