#: inc/admin-settings.php:194
msgid "Show hours as"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:196
msgid "Decimal is what a court order is usually written in."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:202
msgid "Allow shifts dated in the future"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:203
msgid "Off by default. A shift dated next Tuesday is a typo far more often than a plan, and on a document a court reads it discredits the whole record."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:209
msgid "Let volunteers send in their own hours"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-settings.php:210
msgid "Off until you switch it on. With it on, this site accepts a name, an email address and a date from anonymous visitors — everything they send arrives unverified and waits for a staff member. Nothing they enter appears publicly."
